# All seven lessons on a phone (390 x 844 at 3x) by touch on the glasshouse's named cards and piles:
# drawing, alternating runs, moving runs and reveals, Kings to empty rows, recycling the stock,
# foundations (double taps) and auto-finish with the coach's Continue, each to its results and on
# through "Next".
# viewport 390x844@3
until 600 Patience
frames 10
touch =Learn
until 120 Lessons
frames 10
touch =Drawing from the Stock
until 300 Tap the stock
frames 60
touch Stock, 2 cards. Activate to draw.
until 120 You drew
frames 20
touch =Eight of Hearts
frames 10
touch =Nine of Spades
until 120 Finish the lesson
frames 20
touch Stock, 1 cards. Activate to draw.
until 120 Double-tap
frames 20
touch =Ace of Spades
frames 2
touch =Ace of Spades
until 200 Lesson complete
frames 30
expect 1/7 lessons complete
touch =Next: Alternating Colors
until 300 Tableau rows build DOWN
frames 60
touch =Eight of Spades
frames 10
touch =Nine of Hearts
until 120 Now the red 7
frames 20
touch =Seven of Diamonds
frames 10
touch =Eight of Spades
until 200 Lesson complete
frames 30
touch =Next: Moving Runs & Reveals
until 300 Face-up runs move together
frames 60
touch =Nine of Spades
frames 10
touch =Ten of Diamonds
until 120 Ace of Clubs
frames 20
touch =Ace of Clubs
frames 2
touch =Ace of Clubs
until 200 Lesson complete
frames 30
touch =Next: Kings and Empty Rows
until 300 Only a King may move
frames 60
touch =King of Spades
frames 10
touch =Row 4, empty
until 120 join her King
frames 20
touch =Queen of Hearts
frames 10
touch =King of Spades
until 200 Lesson complete
frames 30
touch =Next: Cycling the Stock
until 300 Draw the last stock card
frames 60
touch Stock, 1 cards. Activate to draw.
until 120 Tap its outline
frames 20
touch Stock empty. Activate to recycle the waste.
until 120 Draw again
frames 20
key KeyD 1
until 200 Lesson complete
frames 30
touch =Next: Growing the Foundations
until 300 Bank the Ace of Hearts
frames 60
touch =Ace of Hearts
frames 2
touch =Ace of Hearts
until 120 Now the 2 of Hearts
frames 30
touch =Two of Hearts
frames 2
touch =Two of Hearts
until 120 And the 3
frames 30
touch =Three of Hearts
frames 2
touch =Three of Hearts
until 200 Lesson complete
frames 30
touch =Next: The Autofinish
until 300 Only the four Kings remain
frames 60
save lesson-autofinish
touch Auto-finish
until 300 A complete garden
frames 60
touch =Continue
until 200 Lesson complete
frames 30
expect 7/7 lessons complete
expect Graduate unlocked
save lessons-done
